List deleted inodes in an ext2/3/4 image (like debugfs lsdel) and optionally recover their data

Usage: android-doctor deleted [OPTIONS] <IMAGE>

Arguments:
  <IMAGE>  

Options:
      --no-color               Never emit colour, even on a terminal (also honours the NO_COLOR environment variable)
  -o, --output <OUTPUT>        Write recovered files into this new directory (files/ plus manifest.json); without it, list only
      --max-bytes <MAX_BYTES>  Maximum bytes of recovered data per file (default 1 MiB) [default: 1048576]
      --json                   Print JSON instead of text
  -h, --help                   Print help
